<title>MEXICO: Foreign investment in Mexican securities grows.</title>
<headline>Foreign investment in Mexican securities grows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 7.11 percent in May to $40.99 billion compared with April levels, the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said foreign investment in stocks rose 7.90 percent to $37.26 billion, while in the money market it fell 0.16 percent to $3.73 billion.</p>
<p>				  May	Apr     Monthly    Yearly</p>
<p>				    31	31     Change     Change</p>
<p>				 ($bln)  ($bln)    (pct)	 (pct)</p>
