<p>Neutral Fund	(2)     4.163   4.085    1.90	 18.71</p>
<p>ADRs		  (3)    19.105  17.563    8.78	 26.46</p>
<p>Mexico Fund	 (4)     1.054   0.998    5.66	 14.58</p>
